          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਭਰਜਾਈ — bharjāī — \"a brother's wife\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੇਰੀ ਭਰਜਾਈ ਸਕੂਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਬੱਚਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਸਿਖਾਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ। merī bharjāī sakūl vich bachchiāṁ nū̃ panjābī sikhāundī hai. My brother's wife teaches Punjabi to children at school."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਭਰਜਾਈ (bharjāī) is inherited from Sanskrit bhrāturjāyā, \"a brother's wife\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi bharjāī, \"brother's wife\", under it (CDIAL 9660)."
            }
          ]
        },
